Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This CL mitigates a vulnerability in MusicFxHelper where untrusted
intents provided by callers were directly relayed as system broadcasts.

1. Intent Sanitization: Instead of relaying the caller's intent
wholesale,
   MusicFxHelper now reconstructs a fresh intent, explicitly copying only
   known, safe extras (EXTRA_AUDIO_SESSION, EXTRA_PACKAGE_NAME, and
   EXTRA_CONTENT_TYPE).
2. Receiver Restriction: The receiver query now enforces
   PackageManager.MATCH_SYSTEM_ONLY, ensuring that the control intents
   are only delivered to trusted system components.
3. Added unit tests to AudioServiceTests to verify the sanitization and
   receiver query logic.

Flag: EXEMPT BUGFIX
